 # Add mutation-time consistency checks (parent/child, blocker resolution, dangling refs, cycles)
 
@@ -23,4 +23,13 @@
 
 Design resolved via peer review, not assumed: targeted per-key disk lookups (collectSubtasks, resolveParentFromPath, resolveTaskFile) rather than threading a materialized Task[] into mutate.ts -- avoids both a signature-widening churn and a real bulk-mutation staleness bug a full-array design would have had. Requires relocating collectSubtasks/resolveParentFromPath from move.ts (private) to patterns.ts to avoid a mutate.ts <-> move.ts circular import, since move.ts already imports from mutate.ts.
 
 Out of scope for this pass (see plan doc): stale resolution on reopen, archived-but-referenced blockers, cross-project parent/child drift, assignee/status smells, duplicate-key detection. Also out of scope: updating the external ~/.local/bin/task-board script to consume this instead of its own client-side JS checks -- Trail-side only for this task.
